<title>FRANCE: Rouen Feb 1-5 wheat exports 83,660 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Feb 1-5 wheat exports 83,660 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached 83,660 tonnes between February 1 and February 5, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 484,000 tonnes in the whole of February 1996.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>    Egypt			   10,000</p>
<p>    Britain			  3,260</p>
<p>    Greece			  13,350</p>
<p>    Italy			   21,000</p>
<p>    Morocco			 19,050</p>
<p>    Tunisia			 17,000</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
